message: "If you use Funoos in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Funoos — fluid simulation laboratory"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SalehMohammadrezaei/Funoos"
authors:
  - family-names: Mohammadrezaei
    given-names: Saleh
    email: salehmrezaee@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  A desktop application for exploring two-dimensional fluid motion and pattern
  formation with five from-scratch solvers (lattice Boltzmann, incompressible
  projection, compressible finite volume, SPH, pseudo-spectral) and a
  reaction–diffusion model, with documented models, checks and limitations.
